<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Treasury says no note tender Wed.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Treasury says no note tender Wed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury said there will be no Treasury note tender this week.  </p>
<p>The Treasury last week offered a total of A$300 million in 13-week note maturities.</p>
<p>There are A$375 million of non-official holdings of T-notes maturing in the week ending December 5.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
